sequenceDiagram
  participant extension
  participant broker
  participant user
  extension->>broker: POST /v1/device/code with surface and scopes
  broker-->>extension: code and approval URL, valid 10 minutes
  extension->>user: show the code
  user->>broker: approve the code on the broker's page
  extension->>broker: POST /v1/device/secret with code and instance
  broker-->>extension: 256-bit secret bound to the approved grant
